{"name":"Handmade","hex":"#7f735f","fetched":"2026-10-16","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"handmade","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Made by hand; manufactured manually."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["An art or craft object made by hand."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/handmade"}],"entries":[{"title":"Handicraft","blocks":[{"text":"A handicraft is a traditional main sector of craft making and applies to a wide range of creative and design activities that are related to making things with one's hands and skill, including work with textiles, moldable and rigid materials, paper, plant fibers, clay, etc. Usually, the term is applied to traditional techniques of creating items that are both practical and aesthetic. Handicraft industries are those that produce things with hands to meet the needs of the people in their locality without using machines."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a3/Women_Making_Batik%2C_Ketelan_crop.jpg/330px-Women_Making_Batik%2C_Ketelan_crop.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Handicraft","wikidata":"Q877729"},{"title":"Handmade (The Ongoing Concept album)","blocks":[{"text":"Handmade is the second studio album from the Ongoing Concept. Solid State Records released the album on June 16, 2015."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/2/27/Handmade_by_The_Ongoing_Concept.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Handmade_(The_Ongoing_Concept_album)","wikidata":"Q20647398"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a3/Women_Making_Batik%2C_Ketelan_crop.jpg/500px-Women_Making_Batik%2C_Ketelan_crop.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a3/Women_Making_Batik%2C_Ketelan_crop.jpg/500px-Women